# T8i review 6: SAVE held in STUDIO shows no old X0X feedback (no "P1 COPIED", no help
# card) before SONGS opens at ~600 ms; SAVE as a modifier does not open it, and a short
# SAVE tap still saves.
wait 300
press SAVE
wait 300
expect songson 0
expect msg 0
expect help 0
shot save_hold300.png
wait 200
expect songson 0
expect msg 0
expect help 0
shot save_hold500.png
wait 200
expect songson 1
release SAVE
wait 40
expect songson 1
tap HOME
wait 40
expect songson 0
# SAVE with HOME is a modifier: no SONGS, and no save banner from a copy either
press HOME
press SAVE
wait 800
expect songson 0
release SAVE
release HOME
wait 40
# a short SAVE tap still saves (no SONGS)
tap SAVE
wait 60
expect songson 0
shot save_tap.png
